# Retail builds first, then 16001 for WoW Forever (1.60.1). Forever belongs to
# the mainline family, so the game reads this file on it rather than
# WayBook.toc, and the packager tags the CurseForge upload for Forever off that
# number. One list beats a separate _Camelot.toc: the packager does not
# recognise a _Forever suffix at all.
#
# The retail numbers accumulate rather than getting replaced, the way TomTom's
# own TOC does it. A client treats the addon as current when any listed number
# matches its own, so dropping 12.0.7 and 12.1.0 would only strand anyone who
# has not patched. 120105 is 12.1.5, added 2026-11-16 because the addon list
# had started flagging WayBook out of date on a patched retail client.
## Interface: 120007, 120100, 120105, 16001
## Title: WayBook
## Notes: Clickable directory of your saved TomTom waypoints, grouped and colored by zone
## Author: Hrudrak
## Version: 1.28.0
## License: MIT
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\WayBook\WayBook-Icon.tga
## Dependencies: TomTom
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: WayBookDB
## X-Curse-Project-ID: 1651700

WayBook.lua
